{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client-host",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "CLIENT HOST",
      "color": "brand"
    },
    {
      "id": "client-host-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 185,
      "text": "## Codex / Claude harness\n\n- Runs on olthoi0, malar, or another host\n- Starts MCP servers over stdio today\n- Carries a Matrix-facing identity such as `codex-hostname-null`\n- Should not need to be launched through agents-js just to use tools",
      "color": "brand"
    },
    {
      "id": "today",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "TODAY: PROVISION EVERYWHERE",
      "color": "warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "today-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 185,
      "text": "## dot-matrix MCP stdio\n\n- `mcp-server.py` runs as a local child process\n- Reads homeserver, room id, and token from local `gopass`\n- `send_message` chooses identity with `as_agent`\n- Fast path for first olthoi0 smoke",
      "color": "warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 310,
      "label": "TARGET: AGENTS-JS HOSTED MCP",
      "color": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "target-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 225,
      "text": "## Provider-backed tools\n\n- agents-js hosts MCP tools such as `SendMessage` and `FetchContext`\n- `MatrixToolProvider` hides the backend (`dot-matrix`, proxy, or future service)\n- `MetricsProvider` consumes harness-native telemetry\n- Host bootstrap provisions identity and config",
      "color": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "MATRIX + BRIDGE",
      "color": "brand"
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## Shared room transport\n\n- Matrix homeserver owns room events\n- dot-matrix bridge observes events and routes mentions\n- Bridge policy decides which agent senders can fan out to gated agents",
      "color": "brand"
    }
  ],
